    narr:narration """The implementation of a [mandatory release gate](narr:Expr_1ProtectedBaseProbe_1) for Meridian deployments is framed as a direct response to [past security lapses](narr:Expr_1ProtectedBaseProbe_2) involving unsigned artifacts in staging. Quinton Fairweather has established this requirement as a [formal directive](narr:Expr_1ProtectedBaseProbe_3), explicitly defining the [operational scope](narr:Expr_1ProtectedBaseProbe_4) to cover both staging and production environments. Ownership of this enforcement mechanism is [formally assigned](narr:Expr_1ProtectedBaseProbe_5) to Fairweather, grounding the gate in a clear, top-down authority structure intended to ensure consistency across all future deployments.""" ;
    narr:covers <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_1ProtectedBaseProbe_1> ;
    narr:covers <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_1ProtectedBaseProbe_2> ;
    narr:covers <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_1ProtectedBaseProbe_3> ;
    narr:covers <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_1ProtectedBaseProbe_4> ;
    narr:covers <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_1ProtectedBaseProbe_5> ;
    narr:keyPhrase [ narr:text "Every Meridian deployment now requires a signed release\nmanifest before it ships." ; narr:phraseSource <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_1ProtectedBaseProbe_1> ] ;
    narr:keyPhrase [ narr:text "We saw two unsigned artifacts reach staging\nlast quarter and that is the whole reason for the gate." ; narr:phraseSource <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_1ProtectedBaseProbe_2> ] ;
    narr:keyPhrase [ narr:text "**Scope**: applies to staging and production" ; narr:phraseSource <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_1ProtectedBaseProbe_4> ] ;
    narr:keyPhrase [ narr:text "**Owner**: Quinton Fairweather" ; narr:phraseSource <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_1ProtectedBaseProbe_5> ] ;
    narr:variation [ narr:text "The justification for the gate rests on a specific past failure, contrasting with the abstract, rule-based framing of the requirement itself." ; narr:over <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_1ProtectedBaseProbe_1> ; narr:over <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_1ProtectedBaseProbe_2> ] ;
    narr:voiceTrait [ narr:dim "style" ; narr:reading "Relies on standardized, authoritative phrasing to codify decisions, punctuated by plain-spoken accounts of the underlying problem." ; narr:text "Every Meridian deployment now requires a signed release\nmanifest before it ships." ; narr:phraseSource <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_1ProtectedBaseProbe_1> ] ;
    narr:voiceTrait [ narr:dim "register" ; narr:reading "Shifts between formal, technical definitions of policy and direct, colloquial explanations of historical necessity." ; narr:text "We saw two unsigned artifacts reach staging\nlast quarter and that is the whole reason for the gate." ; narr:phraseSource <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_1ProtectedBaseProbe_2> ] ;
